  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup all-purpose flour",
    "6 tablespoons cold butter, cut into small pieces",
    "0.25 cup shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "5 teaspoons cold water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CjidUxO9wWHgrI_kaLQxheAVPB8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-007-step-01-06fd51ce92af495fbcae4f34ff39ae1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/107297/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour in a large bowl. Sprinkle in butter; rub butter into flour until it resembles bread crumbs. Stir in cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MwD-SQtU9_5laV6sqnKE-9YgGm4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-008-step-02-f3d605ed7f944f1d870a16069b58309b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/107297/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle cold water over flour mixture, a teaspoon at a time, stirring lightly with a fork. Add just enough water to allow dough to form a ball and cleanly leave the sides of the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tGIwF6U3tRp1gu0KUKeVOKFNZfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-009-step-03-75646bb39d294a08a34235f264ed5ff1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/107297/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap dough in plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZGRu3FYzKXrBJCtCLqyDFGsXmYE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-010-step-04-71087b3ab59744bbb047680f4f122c95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/107297/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out dough and place in a 9-inch pie or quiche pan. Use a fork to prick holes over the bottom of pastry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fXCRtlmtX2rBh6VOJoo2Funz9Rc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-011-step-05-176a60fd20af43e29d207d68711d40bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/107297/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake crust in the preheated oven for 10 minutes before filling with quiche filling of your choice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h42zGBvxZlTo8LZkNC5E6TK_DkQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/107297-cheesy-quiche-crust-VAT-012-step-06-eef93da6b6c447afac34f5b86c29c342.jpg"
